{"name": "Project Revenant", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\"One step from death. One shot from victory.\"</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&lt;Project Revenant&gt;</i> is a remake and successor to &lt;<i>Revenant&gt;</i>.<br/>a game where a single hit can end everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"504\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/84ba39cadcc5fb00e00e797e003a2553.poster.avif?t=1787068073\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/84ba39cadcc5fb00e00e797e003a2553.webm?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/84ba39cadcc5fb00e00e797e003a2553.mp4?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive, you must master the unique combat system known as <strong>\u201cPrecision Aiming\u201d</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">where only enemies directly under your cursor will take damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not a game where you can spray bullets and hope for the best.<br/>You\u2019ll need to carefully analyze each enemy\u2019s position and attack pattern, then strike with accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Headshot an enemy to take them out instantly, shoot down a chandelier to crush enemies beneath it,<br/>or ignite an explosive barrel to wipe out a group of foes. Every encounter is a tactical decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Gimmicks</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/302523761dcab76da2941de7923ba02a.poster.avif?t=1787068073\" width=\"748\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/302523761dcab76da2941de7923ba02a.webm?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/302523761dcab76da2941de7923ba02a.mp4?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage introduces new gimmicks\u2014use them creatively to defeat waves of enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Distinct Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/388ccb05a6c6f58843d93ab41758b7bc.poster.avif?t=1787068073\" width=\"914\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/388ccb05a6c6f58843d93ab41758b7bc.webm?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/388ccb05a6c6f58843d93ab41758b7bc.mp4?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/706eba188d6534ad87e9a3af070f3942.poster.avif?t=1787068073\" width=\"416\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/706eba188d6534ad87e9a3af070f3942.webm?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/706eba188d6534ad87e9a3af070f3942.mp4?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyborg ninjas, giant robots, bounty hunters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against RPG-style bosses with memorable designs and mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Skills</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/c1d966ea08f9a082bb814aa86184b717.poster.avif?t=1787068073\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/c1d966ea08f9a082bb814aa86184b717.webm?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/c1d966ea08f9a082bb814aa86184b717.mp4?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip skills that match your playstyle and shape your own combat strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Environments</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/700f9d6acbb74cbd638d85bb8e11069e.poster.avif?t=1787068073\" width=\"716\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/700f9d6acbb74cbd638d85bb8e11069e.webm?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/700f9d6acbb74cbd638d85bb8e11069e.mp4?t=1787068073\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From sewers and underground clubs to towering skyscrapers\u2014team up with \"Beta\" and complete your mission.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cinematic-Level Cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"896\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/88d859a7eb3c26f56bf4adb298d05ed2.avif?t=1787068073\" width=\"1600\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow government agent \"Beta\"'s mission, brought to life with cinematic cutscenes and dramatic storytelling.</p></li></ul></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Project Revenant is a side-scrolling shooter that requires \"Precision Aiming\" at hitboxes using the cursor.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/907dc0c2e4d3b8e37d2179b103f31fcdeaddb0ff/header.jpg?t=1787068073", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Shooter", "Pixel Graphics", "Tactical", "Anime", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "MAYFLY", "publishers": "MAYFLY", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3850590", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/CixXcYpvZSQ", "first_seen": 1785708000.0, "review_rank": 198}